w:Life's like a ship in con---stant mo-tion, Some-times high a-nd some-times low.
A2B c|d2d2 (ed) (cB)|(cd)e2c2c2|d2(cd)e2E2A4
w:Where ev'-ry-one must br-ave th-e o--cean, What-so-ev--er winds may blow.
